      "text": "gym_staff (asignaciones staff<->gym)\n-----------------------------\nPK id uuid\ngym_id uuid (FK -> gyms.id)\ncoach_id uuid (FK -> coaches.id)\nrole gym_staff_role\ncan_edit_clients bool\ncan_create_routines bool\ncan_view_payments bool\ncan_manage_staff bool\njoined_at timestamptz\nUNIQUE(gym_id, coach_id)\nNOTE: trainer puede trabajar en varios gyms",
